Usage: vp check [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Run format, lint, and type checks.

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...  File paths to pass to fmt and lint

Options:
  --fix                            Auto-fix format and lint issues
  --quiet                          Disable reporting on warnings, only errors are reported
